agents models — Display model tiers (default), sync data, or render docs

USAGE
  agents models [command]

COMMANDS
  sync         Refresh model data and recompute tiers
  render       Regenerate model documentation offline

DEFAULTS
  Without a subcommand, displays the model tier list.

ENVIRONMENT
  AGENTS_CONFIG, CHEZMOI_SOURCE_DIR, HOME: catalog and configuration discovery.

Use agents help <command> for command-specific help.
